==Dialogue==
;Lion's Arch:
:''"I must rely on everyone else to be my eyes and ears. So tell me, is there anything that requires my attention?"''
:'''Tell me about yourself.'''
:''"I am Firstwatch of the Lionguard. We are the last bastion of the glory of old Kryta."''
:'''How can I be of service to the Lionguard?'''
::''"The Lionguard patrols not only the city, but the countryside beyond. be ready to aid the Lionguard if you encounter them, I will hear of it."''
::'''Why is that?'''
:::''"Though the White Mantle and their Unseen gods may rule the realm, we still retain the honor of protecting the great city of Lion's Arch, as we have for time immemorial."''
:'''Interesting. Tell me more.'''
::''"Though the White Mantle and their Unseen gods may rule the realm, we still retain the honor of protecting the great city of Lion's Arch, as we have for time immemorial."''
::'''What is a "Firstwatch?"'''
:::''"Why, I am the leader of the Lionguard! My predecessor had allowed the reputation of the Lionguard to falter, but I mean to restore honor and glory to her ranks once more."'' 
:::'''What does the Lionguard do?'''
::::''"Though the White Mantle and their Unseen gods may rule the realm, we still retain the honor of protecting the great city of Lion's Arch, as we have for time immemorial."''
:::'''Do you have quarrel with the White Mantle?'''
::::''"Not at all. My concern is for the well-being of the people of Kryta. many view the White Mantle as saviors. Let them think that. The Lionguard simply provide protection for those who still worship the old [[gods]]. Kryta has a great history, and I see no reason to forget our traditions."''
::::'''What are the traditions of the Lionguard?'''
:::::''"Though the White Mantle and their Unseen gods may rule the realm, we still retain the honor of protecting the great city of Lion's Arch, as we have for time immemorial."''
::'''Did you fight the in war against [[Ascalon]]?'''
:::''"Let bygones be bygones, [Character Name]. That's some advice worth following. I can tell you this much. I saw Ascalon once, before the [[Searing]]. It was beautiful then, a stark contrast to the blasted landscape there today."''
:{{x}} '''Good  day to you, Sergio.'''

;Droknar's Forge (explorable area):
:''"With the White Mantle crumbling, it's time for Kryta to rebuild, and for Salma to lead us all into the future. I have agreed to lead the Lionguard and serve Her Majesty as a trusted advisor. This is the beginning of a new age for Kryta."''

;During the Battle for Lion's Arch:
:''"Alright. I hope everyone is fully ready. You might want to take a few steps back."''

;Lion's Arch (War in Kryta):
:''"At long last, Kryta is free from the White Mantle and their deranged puppet-masters. Once we've had a chance to assess our losses, the Lionguard will be in need of worthy recruits to bolster our numbers. We're responsible for the safety of Lion's Arch, after all! Say, you're not looking for a new job are you?"''

